==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|frm|contre}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|contre}}, from {{inh|fr|la|contra}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}
* {{audio|fr|Fr-contre.ogg|audio}}

===Preposition===
{{fr-prep}}

# [[against]] {{gloss|in physical contact with}}
#: {{ux|fr|La paille est '''contre''' la maison|the straw is '''against''' the house}}
#: {{ux|fr|Elle s'appuie '''contre''' le mur.|She's pushing '''against''' the wall.}}
# [[against]] {{gloss|not in favor of}}
#: {{ux|fr|Les citoyens sont pour, mais les hommes politiques sont '''contre'''.|The citizens are for, but the politicians are '''against'''.}}
# [[against]] {{gloss|having as an opponent}}
#: {{ux|fr|Ce soir: Lille '''contre''' Marseille en direct.|Tonight: Lille '''against''' Marseille live.}}
# [[as against]] {{gloss|[[as opposed to]], compared to, in contrast with}}
#: {{ux|fr|10% des hommes ont eu plus de cent partenaires sexuels, '''contre''' 5% seulement des femmes.|10 percent of all men have had more than a hundred sexual partners, '''as opposed to''' 5 percent of all women.}}
# [[in exchange]] for
#: {{ux|fr|On peut échanger ces billets '''contre''' un repas gratuit.|These tickets can be exchanged '''for''' a free meal.}}

